---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Do I need to collect or label training images?',
    a: 'No. A new part needs only its CAD model. AssembleX generates its own reference views from the geometry.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if I don’t have a CAD model?',
    a: 'Talk to us. We’ll take it from there and work out the best route for your part.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What camera does it use?',
    a: 'An RGB-D camera, which gives both colour and depth. Depth lets the system compare real geometry against the CAD.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which robots does it work with?',
    a: 'The perception layer sits between the camera and motion planning and is designed to work across multiple robot brands. Tell us what you run and we’ll confirm fit.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Where does it run?',
    a: 'On industrial edge hardware next to the cell. It does not depend on heavy GPU or foundation-model inference.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How long does it take to add a new part?',
    a: 'There is no training step. The system is designed so a new part can go live the same day.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How mature is it?',
    a: 'Zero-shot pose estimation is validated in simulation, and real-rig validation is in progress. We share results as they are measured rather than quoting numbers in advance.',
  },
];
---

<section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-[120px]">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-4 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 lg:px-16">

    <div class="reveal lg:col-span-4">
      <p class="section-label mb-4">FAQ</p>
      <h2
        class="mb-5 font-inter font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.025em] text-sp-heading"
        style="font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 44px);"
      >
        Questions engineers ask us.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.7] text-sp-body">
        Something else? <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-sp-green underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal lg:col-span-8">
      {faqs.map((f, i) => (
        <details class="faq group border-b border-sp-border" open={i === 0}>
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[19px] font-semibold text-sp-heading">
            {f.q}
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-sp-border text-sp-green transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[18px] leading-[1.7] text-sp-body">{f.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
</style>
